7. **Apply and verify.**
   - Run each step as `sudo NEEDRESTART_MODE=l choom -n 0 -- unattended-upgrade -v`, at adj 0, with no hard memory cap. A `MemoryMax` kill mid-dpkg is worse than the risk it covers.
